	(text "make sure that the SPI's clock, MOSI and MISO lines are length match \nand run as close to each other on the layout as possible, with <0.5 mm \nof mismatch in length. good design practice for any fast-edge clock or driver circuits.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.112 215.138 0)
